7787-1.862109C.347787-.514435 1.115816 .84773 2.115703 1.463603L2.20265 1.347674C1.246236 .594136 .970905-.282577 .970905-1.883845C.970905-3.49236 1.267973-4.325599 2.20265-5.079137L2.13744-5.195066Z\" id=\"m006_g4-185\"></path><path d=\"M.275331-5.195066L.210121-5.079137C1.144798-4.325599 1.441866-3.49236 1.441866-1.883845C1.441866-.282577 1.166535 .594136 .210121 1.347674L.297068 1.463603C1.296955 .84773 2.064984-.514435 2.064984-1.862109C2.064984-3.340203 1.325937-4.513984 .275331-5.195066Z\" id=\"m006_g4-186\"></path><path d=\"M2.166422 1.217254H1.543304C1.304201 1.217254 1.188272 1.094079 1.188272 .840485V-4.622667C1.188272-4.847279 1.282464-4.941472 1.514322-4.941472H2.166422V-5.122611H.637609V1.398393H2.166422V1.217254Z\" id=\"m006_g4-187\"></path><path d=\"M.246349 1.217254V1.398393H1.775162V-5.122611H.246349V-4.941472H.869467C1.108571-4.941472 1.2245-4.818297 1.2245-4.564702V.898449C1.2245 1.123062 1.123062 1.217254 .898449 1.217254H.246349Z\" id=\"m006_g4-188\"></path></defs><g id=\"m006_page1\"><use x=\"-68.76215\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g13-51\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-63.570814\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g10-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"-56.454456\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g1-61\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-47.350888\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g20-67\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-40.705809\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g20-111\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-35.724489\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g20-110\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-31.042051\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g20-118\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-25.562597\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g7-185\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"-21.248776\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g7-187\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-15.971958\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g20-85\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-9.077813\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g20-112\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"-3.598359\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g7-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\".366764\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g13-51\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"5.5581\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g10-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"9.409008\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g4-184\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"14.034462\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g17-49\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"18.168929\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g7-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"21.984605\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g13-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"28.055081\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g13-52\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"32.788131\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g10-18\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"38.797556\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g7-188\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"42.71287\" xlink:href=\"#m006_g7-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">FCN 上采样边界粗，生物医学标注稀缺</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">FCN upsampling lost fine boundary localization, while annotated biomedical datasets were small.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">对称 encoder-decoder 与同尺度长跳连联合语义和精确定位</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pair a contracting semantic encoder with a symmetric expanding decoder linked by same-scale feature concatenation skips.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">concat skips、强弹性增强与面向少样本的 U 形多尺度拓扑</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Concatenation long skips, distance-weighted boundary loss, and elastic deformations tailored for few-shot biomedical segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为医学分割基础设施，U-shaped encoder-decoder 也被广泛复用于重建和去噪</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Universal infrastructure of biomedical segmentation; the U-shaped topology is also standard across denoising, reconstruction, and diffusion.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">领域基础设施；必须从零实现和保留为强基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Cornerstone domain infrastructure; mandatory to master from scratch and retain as a primary baseline.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">编码器用下采样获得上下文，解码器负责恢复空间定位。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">同尺度长跳连绕过瓶颈传递边缘、纹理和小结构坐标。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">concat 而非相加允许解码器重新选择浅层与深层证据。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Pair a contracting semantic encoder with a symmetric expanding decoder linked by same-scale feature concatenation skips.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Concatenation long skips, distance-weighted boundary loss, and elastic deformations tailored for few-shot biomedical segmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: U-Net Same-Scale Feature Concatenation Across Contraction and Expansion Paths.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">器官、病灶和细胞分割的强拓扑基线，后续多数变体仍保留其信息路径。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">长跳连也会传递背景纹理；semantic gap、spacing 与完整训练 pipeline 仍需单独处理。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Universal infrastructure of biomedical segmentation; the U-shaped topology is also standard across denoising, reconstruction, and diffusion.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Cornerstone domain infrastructure; mandatory to master from scratch and retain as a primary baseline.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-24574-4_28\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>U-Net: Convolutional Networks for Biomedical Image Segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://lmb.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/lmbsoft/unet/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}